{"seq":3,"slug":"open-source-vs-proprietary","title":"开源与闭源模型的成本权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi/open-source-vs-proprietary","wordCount":1972,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"开源与闭源模型的成本权衡\">开源与闭源模型的成本权衡</h1><p>把「开源便宜、闭源贵」当成结论，是 2024 年的旧地图。到 2026 年，价格曲线已经把这条直觉拆得七零八落：闭源旗舰 Claude Opus 4.8 报价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5/</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5/</span></span></span></span></span>25（输入/输出，每百万 token），而开源权重的 DeepSeek V4 Flash 通过托管 API 只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.14/</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.14/</span></span></span></span></span>0.28（<a href=\"https://www.spheron.network/blog/deepseek-vs-llama-4-vs-qwen3/\">Spheron 2026 对比</a>、<a href=\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/anthropic-claude-api-pricing/\">CloudZero Anthropic 定价</a>）——单价差出近两个数量级。但单价从来不是总成本，本节要算的是「自建 vs 采购」语境下，开源权重真正省不省钱、什么时候省。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三条价格曲线而非两个阵营\">核心概念：三条价格曲线而非两个阵营</h2><p>真正的决策不是「开源 or 闭源」二选一，而是三种获取方式的总拥有成本（TCO）在不同 token 量级上的交叉。把它们画在同一张图上才看得清。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[需要 LLM 能力] --&gt; B{获取方式}&#10;  B --&gt;|闭源 API| C[Claude / GPT-5.5&lt;br/&gt;零运维 固定单价高]&#10;  B --&gt;|开源权重托管 API| D[Together / Fireworks 跑 Llama·DeepSeek&lt;br/&gt;单价低 仍无运维]&#10;  B --&gt;|开源权重自建| E[自购/租 GPU + vLLM&lt;br/&gt;单价最低 运维成本高]&#10;  C --&gt; F{月 token 量}&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt;|低于约 6 亿/月| G[闭源或托管 API 胜&lt;br/&gt;带缓存更稳]&#10;  F --&gt;|高于约 12 亿/月| H[自建摊薄固定成本&lt;br/&gt;开始划算]\">flowchart TD\n  A[需要 LLM 能力] --&gt; B{获取方式}\n  B --&gt;|闭源 API| C[Claude / GPT-5.5&lt;br/&gt;零运维 固定单价高]\n  B --&gt;|开源权重托管 API| D[Together / Fireworks 跑 Llama·DeepSeek&lt;br/&gt;单价低 仍无运维]\n  B --&gt;|开源权重自建| E[自购/租 GPU + vLLM&lt;br/&gt;单价最低 运维成本高]\n  C --&gt; F{月 token 量}\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt;|低于约 6 亿/月| G[闭源或托管 API 胜&lt;br/&gt;带缓存更稳]\n  F --&gt;|高于约 12 亿/月| H[自建摊薄固定成本&lt;br/&gt;开始划算]</pre><p>关键反直觉点：开源权重最便宜的用法往往不是自建，而是用 Together AI、Fireworks 这类托管商跑开源模型——它们以薄利和规模化基础设施提供 Llama 4 Maverick 约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.15</mn><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15–</span></span></span></span></span>0.20/百万输入 token（<a href=\"https://www.spheron.network/blog/deepseek-vs-llama-4-vs-qwen3/\">Spheron</a>）。自建只有在量足够大、运维团队已经存在时才进入第三条曲线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>获取方式</th>\n<th>代表选项</th>\n<th>输入/输出单价（百万 token）</th>\n<th>运维负担</th>\n<th>何时最优</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>闭源 API</td>\n<td>Claude Opus 4.8</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 /</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5/</span></span></span></span></span>25</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>量小、要顶级能力、要省人力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>闭源 API</td>\n<td>GPT-5.5</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 /</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5/</span></span></span></span></span>30</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>同上，OpenAI 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开源托管 API</td>\n<td>DeepSeek V4 Flash</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.14 /</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.14/</span></span></span></span></span>0.28</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>量中、可接受非旗舰能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开源托管 API</td>\n<td>Llama 4 Maverick（Fireworks）</td>\n<td>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext> </mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15 / ~</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15/</span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"> </span></span></span></span></span>0.20</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>量中、要 1M 上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开源自建</td>\n<td>vLLM + 租用 GPU</td>\n<td>趋近 GPU 摊销价</td>\n<td>高（需 MLOps）</td>\n<td>量极大、数据须留内网</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>价格来源：<a href=\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/anthropic-claude-api-pricing/\">CloudZero</a>、<a href=\"https://www.aipricing.guru/openai-pricing/\">aipricing.guru</a>、<a href=\"https://www.spheron.network/blog/deepseek-vs-llama-4-vs-qwen3/\">Spheron</a>（均为 2026 年报价，随行情变动，决策前请复核当日定价页）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自建的隐性成本-单价之外的五项\">自建的隐性成本：单价之外的五项</h2><p>「开源权重免费下载」这句话只对了一半。模型权重不要钱，但把它跑成生产服务要钱，而且大头不在 GPU。一份 2026 年的实测把最小可用的生产部署年成本算到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>125</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">125,000–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">125</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000–</span></span></span></span></span>190,000，其中人力、运维、编排占了绝大部分（<a href=\"https://featherless.ai/blog/llm-api-pricing-comparison-2026-complete-guide-inference-costs\">Featherless 2026 指南</a>）。</p>\n<p>把自建 TCO 拆开，至少有五项隐性成本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>GPU 摊销</strong>：云 GPU 按模型大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.50</mn><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.50–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.50–</span></span></span></span></span>5.00/小时，自购则是一次性资本支出加折旧（<a href=\"https://whatllm.org/best-open-source-llm\">whatllm.org</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>MLOps 人力</strong>：一名 ML 工程师全包薪酬约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>20K/月。低于 $10K/月 API 支出时自建在财务上「非理性」，因为光一个工程师就吃掉全部预算（<a href=\"https://tokenmix.ai/blog/self-host-llm-vs-api\">TokenMix 盈亏分析</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>推理编排与可观测性</strong>：vLLM、TGI、llama.cpp 本身零许可费，但需要工程能力部署、调优、维护（<a href=\"https://tokenmix.ai/blog/self-host-llm-vs-api\">TokenMix</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>能力税（capability tax）</strong>：开源权重模型在同任务上重试率通常高 30%–40%，这部分额外 token 与失败成本要算进 TCO（<a href=\"https://tokenmix.ai/blog/self-host-llm-vs-api\">TokenMix</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>闲置成本</strong>：自建 GPU 不像 API 按量计费，低谷期空转的算力照样付钱，利用率（utilization）直接决定有效单价。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把利用率写进公式更直观。设月 token 量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，开源自建有效单价由固定成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fix</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fix}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fix</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和可变单价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>var</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{var}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">var</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mtext>self</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fix</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>var</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}_{\\text{self}} = C_{\\text{fix}} + p_{\\text{var}} \\cdot V \\cdot (1 + r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">self</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fix</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">var</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是能力税带来的重试放大系数（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span>）。闭源 API 则近似纯可变：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mtext>api</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>api</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}_{\\text{api}} = p_{\\text{api}} \\cdot V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">api</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">api</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>。盈亏平衡点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 出现在两者相等处，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fix</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fix}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fix</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"盈亏平衡-拐点在哪-和谁比\">盈亏平衡：拐点在哪、和谁比</h2><p>「自建几时划算」没有单一答案，因为它取决于你拿谁当基准。和闭源旗舰比，拐点低；和开源托管商比，拐点高得多——因为对手本身已经是优化到极致的薄利基础设施。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[拐点取决于基准对象] --&gt; B[对比闭源旗舰&lt;br/&gt;Claude/GPT-5]&#10;  A --&gt; C[对比开源托管 API&lt;br/&gt;Together/Fireworks]&#10;  B --&gt; D[reserved GPU 约&lt;br/&gt;2M-5M token/天 即平衡]&#10;  B --&gt; E[含 MLOps 全成本约&lt;br/&gt;15-20 亿输出 token/月]&#10;  C --&gt; F[需 50M+ token/天&lt;br/&gt;拐点大幅抬高]&#10;  D --&gt; G[结论 量大才自建]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[拐点取决于基准对象] --&gt; B[对比闭源旗舰&lt;br/&gt;Claude/GPT-5]\n  A --&gt; C[对比开源托管 API&lt;br/&gt;Together/Fireworks]\n  B --&gt; D[reserved GPU 约&lt;br/&gt;2M-5M token/天 即平衡]\n  B --&gt; E[含 MLOps 全成本约&lt;br/&gt;15-20 亿输出 token/月]\n  C --&gt; F[需 50M+ token/天&lt;br/&gt;拐点大幅抬高]\n  D --&gt; G[结论 量大才自建]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>几个可落地的数字基准（均为 2026 年实测区间）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>和 GPT-4.1/Claude 4 级闭源比，reserved 云 GPU 自建在约 <strong>每天 2M–5M token</strong> 就能打平（<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/self-hosted-llm-costs-2026/\">sitepoint 自建成本</a>）。</li>\n<li>但把 GPU 摊销、MLOps 薪资、推理编排都算进去，和 Claude Opus 4.6 API 的真实 TCO 平衡点会推到 <strong>每月约 15 亿–20 亿输出 token</strong>（<a href=\"https://tokenmix.ai/blog/self-host-llm-vs-api\">TokenMix</a>）。</li>\n<li>按场景细分：代码类约 <strong>6 亿 token/月</strong>、聊天类约 <strong>12 亿 token/月</strong> 是自建在单价上反超 API 的门槛；低于此，API 标价（尤其叠加 prompt 缓存）更省（<a href=\"https://tokenmix.ai/blog/self-host-llm-vs-api\">TokenMix</a>）。</li>\n<li>和开源托管商比，拐点跳到 <strong>每天 50M+ token</strong>，因为它们已在规模上把单价压到接近成本（<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/self-hosted-llm-costs-2026/\">sitepoint</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一条经验法则：月 API 支出低于 $20,000 的团队，算上运维开销后几乎不可能靠自建省钱（<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/self-hosted-llm-costs-2026/\">sitepoint</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格不是唯一变量-控制权与合规重排账本\">价格不是唯一变量：控制权与合规重排账本</h2><p>2026 年最大的变化，是「买为省钱、建为控制」这条老捷径失效了——开源权重的低价把「便宜」和「可控」放到了账本的同一侧（<a href=\"https://www.mindstudio.ai/blog/open-weight-ai-models-enterprise-automation\">MindStudio 企业自动化</a>）。于是真正把天平压向开源自建的，往往不是单价，而是数据主权。</p>\n<p>对 GDPR、HIPAA、SOC 2 这类合规场景，把模型部署在本地或私有 VPC 内能消除向第三方传输数据这一环——这在医疗、国防、金融科技是硬约束而非偏好（<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/opensource-vs-commercial-llms-the-complete-guide-2026/\">sitepoint 完整指南</a>）。在这些行业，用自有基础设施微调开源模型，等于把敏感数据始终攥在自己手里。</p>\n<p>微调的经济性也在重排账本：开源 7B 模型微调约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.48</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>百万</mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>，而</mtext><mi>G</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>o</mi><mtext>微调约</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.48/百万 token，而 GPT-4o 微调约</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.48/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">百万</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，而</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">GP</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">微调约</span></span></span></span></span>25/百万 token——50 倍的差距直接改写 ROI（<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/opensource-vs-commercial-llms-the-complete-guide-2026/\">sitepoint 指南</a>）。但这里要区分微调与 RAG：若每个回答都要可引用来源（合规、法律、医疗），或希望数据处于访问控制下而非「烤进权重」，RAG 往往比微调更合适（<a href=\"https://www.sthambh.com/blog/rag-vs-fine-tuning-enterprise-2026/\">Sthambh RAG vs 微调</a>）。</p>\n<p>一个量化的「买 vs 建」对照（来自 2026 决策框架）：买方案 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>180</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>许可</mtext><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">180K 许可 +</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">许可</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span>60K 集成 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>治理，第一年</mtext><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi><mtext>约</mtext><mn>93</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40K 治理，第一年 ROI 约 93%；建方案</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">治理，第一年</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">约</span><span class=\"mord\">93</span></span></span></span></span>450K 工程 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>数据</mtext><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120K 数据 +</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数据</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span>80K 基础设施，第一年 ROI 为负，但若自有数据与定制精度每年多产出约 $400K 价值，可在第三年反超（<a href=\"https://www.justthink.ai/blog/build-vs-buy-enterprise-ai-2026\">Just Think AI 决策框架</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"趋势-地板在塌-决策窗口在缩短\">趋势：地板在塌，决策窗口在缩短</h2><p>不要把今天的盈亏平衡点刻进合同。推理成本仍在快速下塌：量化技术与更便宜的 GPU 让推理成本一年降了 40%–60%，自建工具链也围绕 vLLM、Ollama 趋于稳定（<a href=\"https://featherless.ai/blog/llm-api-pricing-comparison-2026-complete-guide-inference-costs\">Featherless</a>）。更长期看，GPT-4 等效能力的单价从 2022 年底约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>百万</mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>跌到</mtext><mn>2026</mn><mtext>年初约</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20/百万 token 跌到 2026 年初约</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">百万</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">跌到</span><span class=\"mord\">2026</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年初约</span></span></span></span></span>0.40/百万 token，大致每年降一个数量级（<a href=\"https://featherless.ai/blog/llm-api-pricing-comparison-2026-complete-guide-inference-costs\">Featherless</a>）。</p>\n<p>这意味着两件事：其一，闭源 API 的「下个季度更便宜」是常态，今天算出来勉强够本的自建项目，可能上线时已经被 API 降价反超；其二，自建的回本周期必须短于价格腰斩周期，否则资本支出会被市场吞掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>别按「开源/闭源」二分，按三条曲线决策：闭源 API、开源托管 API、开源自建——开源最便宜的用法常是托管 API 而非自建。</li>\n<li>2026 单价：Claude Opus 4.8 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5/</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5/</span></span></span></span></span>25、GPT-5.5 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5/</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5/</span></span></span></span></span>30、DeepSeek V4 Flash <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.14/</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.14/</span></span></span></span></span>0.28、Llama 4 Maverick <del>$0.15/</del>$0.20（每百万 token，决策前复核当日定价）。</li>\n<li>自建真实成本在单价之外：GPU 摊销、MLOps 人力（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>20K/月/人）、编排、能力税（重试 +30%–40%）、闲置算力；最小生产部署年成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>125</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">125K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">125</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>190K。</li>\n<li>盈亏平衡看基准：对闭源旗舰约每月 15 亿–20 亿输出 token（含全成本），对开源托管商需每天 50M+ token；月 API 支出 &lt; $20K 几乎不该自建。</li>\n<li>真正压向自建的常是合规与数据主权（GDPR/HIPAA/SOC 2），不是单价；微调开源 vs 闭源有约 50 倍价差，但要先在微调与 RAG 之间选对路径。</li>\n<li>推理价一年降 40%–60%、长期每年降一个数量级——自建回本周期必须短于价格腰斩周期。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"开源与闭源模型的成本权衡","id":"开源与闭源模型的成本权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三条价格曲线而非两个阵营","id":"核心概念-三条价格曲线而非两个阵营"},{"level":2,"text":"自建的隐性成本：单价之外的五项","id":"自建的隐性成本-单价之外的五项"},{"level":2,"text":"盈亏平衡：拐点在哪、和谁比","id":"盈亏平衡-拐点在哪-和谁比"},{"level":2,"text":"价格不是唯一变量：控制权与合规重排账本","id":"价格不是唯一变量-控制权与合规重排账本"},{"level":2,"text":"趋势：地板在塌，决策窗口在缩短","id":"趋势-地板在塌-决策窗口在缩短"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"微调的 ROI 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi/finetuning-roi-model"},"next":{"title":"API 平台竞争格局：2026 年 API 平台竞争格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/platform-competition-and-moats/api-platform-landscape-2026"}}